text:
{
  "name": "Progression",
  "description": "An overview of the flow of the game",
  "icon": "minecraft:writable_book"
}

{
  "name": "Early Game",
  "icon": "irons_spellbooks:inscription_table",
  "category": "irons_spellbooks:root",
  "sortnum": -3,
  "read_by_default": false,
  "pages": [
    {
      "type": "patchouli:text",
      "title": "Overview",
      "text": "Early game progression is dominated by exploring and looting. The world is full of magic loot, especially in new magic structures that can be found dotted across the lands. But be careful! Each magic structure is home to a powerful mage, who will not take kindly to you."
    },
    {
      "type": "patchouli:spotlight",
      "item": "irons_spellbooks:scroll",
      "title": "Scrolls",
      "text": "Scrolls will be your first taste of magic. While they can be consumed to cast the spell they hold, it is better to save them until you can inscribe it into a spell book, where it can be used repeatedly, via an Inscription Table >>>"
    },
    {
      "type": "patchouli:text",
      "title": "Inscription Table",
      "text": "In order to properly use a Spell Book, you must inscribe spells into it with the Inscription Table by using scrolls. Scrolls can be retrieved once put into a Spell Book, but it will uninscribe the spell. Beginner spell books can be crafted with basic materials."
    },
    {
      "type": "patchouli:crafting",
      "recipe": "irons_spellbooks:inscription_table",
      "recipe2": "irons_spellbooks:copper_spell_book"
    },
    {
      "type": "patchouli:spotlight",
      "item": "irons_spellbooks:arcane_essence",
      "title": "Basic Materials",
      "text": "Some basic materials can even be found sparsely in vanilla structures.$(br2)Arcane Essence can be combined with leather armor to craft Wandering Magician armor, an early source of additional max mana."
    },
    {
      "type": "patchouli:entity",
      "name": "Wandering Magician Armor",
      "entity": "minecraft:armor_stand{ArmorItems:[{id:'irons_spellbooks:wandering_magician_boots',Count:1b},{id:'irons_spellbooks:wandering_magician_leggings',Count:1b},{id:'irons_spellbooks:wandering_magician_chestplate',Count:1b},{id:'irons_spellbooks:wandering_magician_helmet',Count:1b}],NoBasePlate:1b}"
    }
  ]
}

{
  "name": "Ink",
  "icon": "irons_spellbooks:epic_ink",
  "category": "irons_spellbooks:root",
  "sortnum": 4,
  "read_by_default": true,
  "pages": [
    {
      "type": "patchouli:spotlight",
      "item": "irons_spellbooks:common_ink",
      "text": "The most common of the inks (ergo the name), common ink can craft the lowest level of spells. If a spell's lowest level is above common, it cannot be crafted with common ink. The same goes for all other inks."
    },
    {
      "type": "patchouli:spotlight",
      "item": "irons_spellbooks:uncommon_ink",
      "text": "Less common than common, it can craft slightly more powerful spells."
    },
    {
      "type": "patchouli:spotlight",
      "item": "irons_spellbooks:rare_ink",
      "text": "The rare ink should be able to be found regularly in magic treasure chests or by killing spellcasting mobs."
    },
    {
      "type": "patchouli:spotlight",
      "item": "irons_spellbooks:epic_ink",
      "text": "The best place for epic ink and all other high rarity inks is from magic treasure or killing spellcasting mobs."
    },
    {
      "type": "patchouli:spotlight",
      "item": "irons_spellbooks:legendary_ink",
      "text": "The most rare ink, it will craft the most powerful spells. Keep in mind, some spells have multiple legendary levels, requiring use of the Arcane Anvil to obtain them."
    },
    {
      "type": "patchouli:empty",
      "draw_filler": false
    }
  ]
}

{
  "name": "Late Game",
  "icon": "irons_spellbooks:arcane_anvil",
  "category": "irons_spellbooks:root",
  "sortnum": -1,
  "read_by_default": true,
  "pages": [
    {
      "type": "patchouli:text",
      "title": "Arcane Anvil",
      "text": "Late game is reached by obtaining netherite and vast quantities of basic resources, and powered by the Arcane Anvil.$(br2)The Arcane Anvil is the most powerful crafting station, used to level up your scrolls, upgrade armor and spell books, and imbue weapons with spells."
    },
    {
      "type": "patchouli:crafting",
      "recipe": "irons_spellbooks:arcane_anvil"
    },
    {
      "type": "patchouli:crafting",
      "title": "More Spell Books",
      "text": "The best craftable spell books are shown here. The ruined book is found in Ancient Cities",
      "recipe": "irons_spellbooks:netherite_spell_book"
    },
    {
      "type": "patchouli:crafting",
      "recipe": "irons_spellbooks:dragonskin_spell_book",
      "text": "Dragonskin is dropped by the Ender Dragon"
    },
    {
      "type": "patchouli:crafting",
      "recipe": "irons_spellbooks:cryomancer_helmet",
      "recipe2": "irons_spellbooks:pyromancer_helmet",
      "title": "School Armor"
    },
    {
      "type": "patchouli:entity",
      "name": "Ex: Cryomancer Armor",
      "entity": "minecraft:armor_stand{ArmorItems:[{id:'irons_spellbooks:cryomancer_boots',Count:1b},{id:'irons_spellbooks:cryomancer_leggings',Count:1b},{id:'irons_spellbooks:cryomancer_chestplate',Count:1b},{id:'irons_spellbooks:cryomancer_helmet',Count:1b}],NoBasePlate:1b}",
      "text": "School armor is made from arcane cloth and a particular school rune, following this template"
    },
    {
      "type": "patchouli:spotlight",
      "item": "irons_spellbooks:upgrade_orb",
      "title": "Upgrading",
      "text": "Upgrades are the final form of progression. By default, any armor as well as spell books can be upgraded.$(br2)Upgrade orbs of a specific attribute are made from a base upgrade orb, and 8 runes of the desired attribute."
    },
    {
      "type": "patchouli:crafting",
      "recipe": "irons_spellbooks:upgrade_orb",
      "recipe2": "irons_spellbooks:fire_upgrade_orb"
    },
    {
      "type": "patchouli:multiblock",
      "name": "Upgrade Crafting Materials",
      "enable_visualize": false,
      "multiblock": {
        "pattern": [
          [
            " D S ",
            "DA0PF"
          ]
        ],
        "mapping": {
          "D": "minecraft:deepslate",
          "A": "irons_spellbooks:deepslate_mithril_ore",
          "P": "irons_spellbooks:armor_pile",
          "S": "minecraft:soul_sand",
          "F": "minecraft:soul_fire"
        }
      },
      "text": "Mithril is a rare Overworld ore, found below y = -38 and unexposed to air. It requires a netherite pickaxe."
    },
    {
      "type": "patchouli:entity",
      "entity": "irons_spellbooks:citadel_keeper",
      "text": "Cinder Essence is dropped from Ancient Knights, which can be awakened by breaking armor piles in the nether."
    }
  ]
}

{
  "name": "Mid Game",
  "icon": "irons_spellbooks:scroll_forge",
  "category": "irons_spellbooks:root",
  "sortnum": -2,
  "read_by_default": true,
  "pages": [
    {
      "type": "patchouli:text",
      "title": "Scroll Forge",
      "text": "Upon reaching nether level resources, you will unlock an entirely new dynamic to gaining power: The Scroll Forge$(br2)The Scroll Forge is used to craft scrolls by using ink, paper, and a focus. The ink determines the rarity (and therefore level), and the focus determines spell's school."
    },
    {
      "type": "patchouli:crafting",
      "recipe": "irons_spellbooks:scroll_forge"
    },
    {
      "type": "patchouli:crafting",
      "title": "New Spell Books",
      "text": "Furthermore, intermediate spell books can be crafted using nether resources",
      "recipe": "irons_spellbooks:gold_spell_book"
    },
    {
      "type": "patchouli:crafting",
      "recipe": "irons_spellbooks:diamond_spell_book",
      "text": "Hogskin is dropped by Hoglins"
    },
    {
      "type": "patchouli:crafting",
      "recipe": "irons_spellbooks:magic_cloth",
      "title": "New Materials",
      "text": "You should also start to craft stronger armor using arcane cloth. In order to get high quantities of arcane essence, you will need to focus on raiding magical structures."
    },
    {
      "type": "patchouli:entity",
      "name": "Scarecrow Armor",
      "entity": "minecraft:armor_stand{ArmorItems:[{id:'irons_spellbooks:pumpkin_boots',Count:1b},{id:'irons_spellbooks:pumpkin_leggings',Count:1b},{id:'irons_spellbooks:pumpkin_chestplate',Count:1b},{id:'irons_spellbooks:pumpkin_helmet',Count:1b}],NoBasePlate:1b}"
    },
    {
      "type": "patchouli:spotlight",
      "item": "irons_spellbooks:blank_rune",
      "title": "Rare Materials",
      "text": "In order to continue progressing, keep an eye out for runestones in magical structures. Runestones are used to craft even more powerful armor. Class mages always drop a rune of their school."
    },
    {
      "type": "patchouli:empty",
      "draw_filler": false
    }
  ]
}

{
  "name": "Schools of Magic",
  "icon": "irons_spellbooks:lightning_bottle",
  "category": "irons_spellbooks:root",
  "sortnum": 20,
  "read_by_default": true,
  "pages": [
    {
      "type": "patchouli:text",
      "title": "Overview",
      "text": "Each magical spell belong to a school of magic. Each school encapsulates a theme, both visually and functionally, and each have a Focus: a representative item used as a crafting ingredient. Furthermore, each school can be empowered by specific school related gear, allowing you to become a powerful master of a single school, or mix and match to become a jack of all trades."
    },
    {
      "type": "patchouli:spotlight",
      "item": "minecraft:blaze_rod",
      "title": "Fire",
      "text": "The Fire school, with a Blaze Rod as its Focus, is centered around damage and damage over time."
    },
    {
      "type": "patchouli:spotlight",
      "item": "irons_spellbooks:frozen_bone",
      "title": "Ice",
      "text": "The Ice school, with Frozen Bones as its Focus, is centered around damage and crowd control."
    },
    {
      "type": "patchouli:spotlight",
      "item": "irons_spellbooks:lightning_bottle",
      "title": "Lightning",
      "text": "The Lightning school, with a Bottle o' Lightning as its Focus, is centered around concentrated damage."
    },
    {
      "type": "patchouli:spotlight",
      "item": "irons_spellbooks:divine_pearl",
      "title": "Holy",
      "text": "The Holy school, with the Divine Pearl as its Focus, is centered around support, healing, and buffing allies."
    },
    {
      "type": "patchouli:spotlight",
      "item": "minecraft:ender_pearl",
      "title": "Ender",
      "text": "The Ender school, with an Ender Pearl as its Focus, is themed around all things arcane and mystical, with spells that range from damage to utility to mobility."
    },
    {
      "type": "patchouli:spotlight",
      "item": "irons_spellbooks:blood_vial",
      "title": "Blood",
      "text": "The Blood school, with a Blood Vial as its Focus, is themed around evil; you will find elements of necromancy, wither, and blood magic here, with spells focusing on damage that buffs the caster."
    },
    {
      "type": "patchouli:spotlight",
      "item": "minecraft:emerald",
      "title": "Evocation",
      "text": "The Evocation school, with an Emerald as its Focus, is themed around magical trickery and conjuration, covering the broadest range of offensive, defensive, and utility spells."
    },
    {
      "type": "patchouli:spotlight",
      "item": "minecraft:poisonous_potato",
      "title": "Nature",
      "text": "The Nature school, with a Poisonous Potato as its Focus, is focused on applying debuffs to enemies, with elements of damage to finish them off."
    },
    {
      "type": "patchouli:spotlight",
      "item": "irons_spellbooks:eldritch_manuscript",
      "title": "Eldritch",
      "text": "The Eldritch school is not like the others. It is an ancient and powerful way of magic, one that has all but been forgotten; you will be unable to immediately craft or cast Eldritch spells. However, shreds of ancient Eldritch manuscripts can still be found scattered throughout the world, and may even be pieced back together with the help of an echo shard."
    },
    {
      "type": "patchouli:spotlight",
      "item": "minecraft:echo_shard",
      "title": "Eldritch, continued",
      "text": "Once a manuscript has been restored, it can be consumed to learn a single Eldritch spell, enabling the crafting and casting of it. After being learned, the Echo Shard is used as the focus."
    }
  ]
}

{
  "name": "Casting Implements",
  "icon": "irons_spellbooks:graybeard_staff",
  "category": "irons_spellbooks:root",
  "sortnum": 3,
  "read_by_default": true,
  "pages": [
    {
      "type": "patchouli:text",
      "title": "Casting Implements",
      "text": "Casting Implements are items that can be right-clicked (used) in order to cast your active spell. Most often, they also provide passive benefits, allowing for a dedicated wizard playstyle."
    },
    {
      "type": "patchouli:crafting",
      "recipe": "irons_spellbooks:graybeard_staff",
      "text": "A simple stick is all it takes to get the crystal ball rolling."
    },
    {
      "type": "patchouli:crafting",
      "recipe": "irons_spellbooks:artificer_cane",
      "text": "Sometimes, additional style is all it takes to bring your casting to the next level."
    },
    {
      "type": "patchouli:crafting",
      "recipe": "irons_spellbooks:ice_staff",
      "text": "Pieces of a mystical frosted staff are rumored to lie about the overworld. The Cryomancer may have research stowed away in his tower revealing more."
    },
    {
      "type": "patchouli:spotlight",
      "item": "irons_spellbooks:blood_staff",
      "text": "An ancient scepter with unmatched summoning abilities, it can only be acquired by taking it from its undead owner."
    }
  ]
}

{
  "name": "Basic Spell Books",
  "icon": "irons_spellbooks:iron_spell_book",
  "category": "irons_spellbooks:root",
  "sortnum": 1,
  "read_by_default": true,
  "pages": [
    {
      "type": "patchouli:text",
      "title": "Craftable Spell Books",
      "text": "Many spell Books can be crafted from a combination of vanilla and arcane materials. Each further tier crafted increases the slot count of the spell book and often comes with extra bonuses, increasing the power and quantity of spells it can contain."
    },
    {
      "type": "patchouli:crafting",
      "recipe": "irons_spellbooks:copper_spell_book",
      "recipe2": "irons_spellbooks:iron_spell_book"
    },
    {
      "type": "patchouli:crafting",
      "recipe": "irons_spellbooks:gold_spell_book",
      "recipe2": "irons_spellbooks:diamond_spell_book"
    },
    {
      "type": "patchouli:crafting",
      "recipe": "irons_spellbooks:netherite_spell_book",
      "recipe2": "irons_spellbooks:dragonskin_spell_book"
    },
    {
      "type": "patchouli:text",
      "title": "Named Spell Books",
      "text": "Named spell books can be found nestled in many corners of the world, often offering bonuses to lucky adventurers looking in the right places."
    },
    {
      "type": "patchouli:spotlight",
      "item": "irons_spellbooks:rotten_spell_book",
      "text": "What may have once been a more powerful book has since rotted away, leaving but three pages. Yet, still more powerful than most Overworld spell books. They can be looted from equally rotten places all across the Overworld."
    },
    {
      "type": "patchouli:spotlight",
      "item": "irons_spellbooks:villager_spell_book",
      "text": "A regular book with a little blessing makes a suitable channel for divine magic. Building a reputation with the villagers, especially by freeing captives from the Archevoker, will ensure one falls into your hands eventually."
    },
    {
      "type": "patchouli:spotlight",
      "item": "irons_spellbooks:blaze_spell_book",
      "text": "Every Blaze, unbeknownst to them, comes with one of these tucked away. The trick is killing them and hoping it doesn't turn into ash."
    },
    {
      "type": "patchouli:crafting",
      "recipe": "irons_spellbooks:druidic_spell_book",
      "text": "A strong magical energy still persists within the Rotten Spell Book. The book may be blessed anew if a proper remedy were applied."
    }
  ]
}

{
  "name": "Scrolls",
  "icon": "irons_spellbooks:scroll",
  "category": "irons_spellbooks:root",
  "sortnum": 0,
  "read_by_default": true,
  "pages": [
    {
      "type": "patchouli:spotlight",
      "title": "Scrolls",
      "item": "irons_spellbooks:scroll",
      "text": "Scrolls can be found in chests, looted from mobs, or crafted. Each Scroll contains a spell with a level, similar to an enchanted book. Scrolls can be upgraded in the Arcane Anvil by combining them with the corresponding rarity of ink of their next level."
    },
    {
      "type": "patchouli:text",
      "text": "Scrolls can be used on their own to cast their spell, subverting mana costs and cooldown, but consuming the scroll in the process. Primarily, they are inscribed into spell books for continued use, or recycled via the Alchemist Cauldron to be turned into more useful spells."
    }
  ]
}

{
  "name": "Unique Spell Books",
  "icon": "irons_spellbooks:evoker_spell_book",
  "category": "irons_spellbooks:root",
  "sortnum": 2,
  "read_by_default": true,
  "pages": [
    {
      "type": "patchouli:text",
      "title": "Unique Spell Books",
      "text": "Unique spell books are rare drops from certain mobs that come with spells inscribed, which cannot be removed or edited. Not every spell book can be manufactured -- it is called the arcane art, after all."
    },
    {
      "type": "patchouli:spotlight",
      "title": "Unique Improvements",
      "item": "irons_spellbooks:arcane_anvil",
      "text": "The spells in a unique spell book are locked, but can be improved. By combining a unique spell book in the Arcane Anvil with a higher-level scroll of the same spell from the spell book, you can raise the level of the locked spell."
    },
    {
      "type": "patchouli:spotlight",
      "item": "irons_spellbooks:evoker_spell_book",
      "text": "A book full of foundational illager magick, the Grimoire of Evokation can be dropped by Evokers or their more powerful casting cousin, Archevokers."
    },
    {
      "type": "patchouli:spotlight",
      "item": "irons_spellbooks:necronomicon_spell_book",
      "text": "An ancient book holding a host of dark spells, it can only be acquired by taking it from its undead owner."
    }
  ]
}

{
  "name": "序盤の攻略",
  "icon": "irons_spellbooks:inscription_table",
  "category": "irons_spellbooks:root",
  "sortnum": -3,
  "read_by_default": false,
  "pages": [
    {
      "type": "patchouli:text",
      "title": "概要",
      "text": "序盤の進行は、探索と略奪が中心となる。世界には魔法の戦利品が溢れており、特に各地に點在する新しい魔法の構造物で多く見つかる。しかし注意してほしい！それぞれの魔法の構造物には強力な魔法使いが住み着いており、侵入者を歓迎することはないだろう。"
    },
    {
      "type": "patchouli:spotlight",
      "item": "irons_spellbooks:scroll",
      "title": "スクロール",
      "text": "スクロールは、魔法を體験する最初の手段となる。消費して呪文を唱えることもできるが、銘刻臺を使って魔導書に書き込めば繰り返し使用できるようになるため、それまで溫存しておくのが賢明だ >>>"
    },
    {
      "type": "patchouli:text",
      "title": "銘刻臺",
      "text": "魔導書を正しく使用するには、銘刻臺を使ってスクロールから呪文を書き込む必要がある。魔導書に入れたスクロールは取り出すことができるが、その場合、呪文の書き込みは解除される。初心者のための魔導書は、基本的な素材で作成できる。"
    },
    {
      "type": "patchouli:crafting",
      "recipe": "irons_spellbooks:inscription_table",
      "recipe2": "irons_spellbooks:copper_spell_book"
    },
    {
      "type": "patchouli:spotlight",
      "item": "irons_spellbooks:arcane_essence",
      "title": "基本素材",
      "text": "一部の基本的な素材は、バニラの構造物でも稀に見つかることがある。$(br2)祕術のエッセンスを革の防具と組み合わせることで、最大マナを増加させる序盤の裝備『放浪の魔術師の防具』を作成できる。"
    },
    {
      "type": "patchouli:entity",
      "name": "放浪の魔術師の防具",
      "entity": "minecraft:armor_stand{ArmorItems:[{id:'irons_spellbooks:wandering_magician_boots',Count:1b},{id:'irons_spellbooks:wandering_magician_leggings',Count:1b},{id:'irons_spellbooks:wandering_magician_chestplate',Count:1b},{id:'irons_spellbooks:wandering_magician_helmet',Count:1b}],NoBasePlate:1b}"
    }
  ]
}

{
  "name": "インク",
  "icon": "irons_spellbooks:epic_ink",
  "category": "irons_spellbooks:root",
  "sortnum": 4,
  "read_by_default": true,
  "pages": [
    {
      "type": "patchouli:spotlight",
      "item": "irons_spellbooks:common_ink",
      "text": "最も一般的なインク（名前の通り）であり、コモンインクは最低レベルの呪文を作成できる。呪文の最低レベルがコモンより上の場合、コモンインクでは作成できない。これは他のすべてのインクにも當てはまる。"
    },
    {
      "type": "patchouli:spotlight",
      "item": "irons_spellbooks:uncommon_ink",
      "text": "コモンよりも一般的ではないが、少し強力な呪文を作成できる。"
    },
    {
      "type": "patchouli:spotlight",
      "item": "irons_spellbooks:rare_ink",
      "text": "レアインクは、魔法の寶箱や、呪文を唱えるモブを倒すことで定期的に見つけられるはずだ。"
    },
    {
      "type": "patchouli:spotlight",
      "item": "irons_spellbooks:epic_ink",
      "text": "エピックインクやその他の高レアリティインクを入手するのに最適な場所は、魔法の寶箱か、呪文を唱えるモブを倒すことだ。"
    },
    {
      "type": "patchouli:spotlight",
      "item": "irons_spellbooks:legendary_ink",
      "text": "最も希少なインクであり、最強の呪文を作成できる。ただし、一部の呪文には複數のレジェンダリーレベルがあり、それらを入手するには祕術の金牀を使用する必要があることを覚えておこう。"
    },
    {
      "type": "patchouli:empty",
      "draw_filler": false
    }
  ]
}

{
  "name": "終盤の攻略",
  "icon": "irons_spellbooks:arcane_anvil",
  "category": "irons_spellbooks:root",
  "sortnum": -1,
  "read_by_default": true,
  "pages": [
    {
      "type": "patchouli:text",
      "title": "祕術の金牀",
      "text": "ネザライトと大量の基本資源を入手し、祕術の金牀を活用することで、ゲーム終盤へと到達する。$(br2)祕術の金牀は最も強力なクラフト設備であり、スクロールのレベルアップ、防具や魔導書のアップグレード、武器への呪文の注入に使用される。"
    },
    {
      "type": "patchouli:crafting",
